{"document":1,"title":"user in #00ca467f:answer_39900a0a_3: I've been dealing with this lingering cough for we...","updated_at":"2023-03-27T01:06:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I've been dealing with this lingering cough for weeks, and I'm getting a bit frustrated. Can you help me find some information on bronchitis and its common symptoms? By the way, I recently had a follow-up appointment with my orthopedic surgeon, Dr. Thompson, on March 20th, and it was a relief to hear that my knee is healing well.","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"00ca467f:answer_39900a0a_3\"}"}
{"document":2,"title":"user in #00ca467f:answer_39900a0a_1: I've been dealing with a lingering cough for six w...","updated_at":"2023-03-27T21:07:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I've been dealing with a lingering cough for six weeks now, and I'm wondering if you can recommend some natural remedies to help soothe my symptoms. By the way, I finally went to see my primary care physician, Dr. Smith, on March 3rd, and he diagnosed me with bronchitis.","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"00ca467f:answer_39900a0a_1\"}"}
{"document":3,"title":"user in #00ca467f:answer_39900a0a_2: I've been dealing with a lingering cough for weeks...","updated_at":"2023-03-27T08:16:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I've been dealing with a lingering cough for weeks, and I'm still trying to figure out what's going on. I had an appointment with my primary care physician, but the antibiotic didn't fully clear it up. I'm also dealing with some weird numbness in my left hand, which is why I have an EMG test scheduled with my neurologist, Dr. Johnson, on April 1st. Can you help me find some information on what could be causing these symptoms?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"00ca467f:answer_39900a0a_2\"}"}
{"document":2,"title":"user in #00ca467f:answer_39900a0a_1: I've been dealing with a lingering cough for six w...","updated_at":"2023-03-27T21:07:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"10. **Consider Over-the-Counter Meds**: If your doctor recommends it, you can try an over-the-counter cough medicine or decongestant to help alleviate symptoms before bed. However, always follow the instructions and consult with your doctor before taking any new medications. Remember to consult with Dr. Smith if your symptoms worsen or if you experience difficulty breathing, chest pain, or fever. I hope these tips help you sleep better and feel more comfortable at night.","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"00ca467f:answer_39900a0a_1\"}"}
{"document":1,"title":"user in #00ca467f:answer_39900a0a_3: I've been dealing with this lingering cough for we...","updated_at":"2023-03-27T01:06:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"4. **Combine with other remedies**: You can combine expectorants with other cough and cold medications, such as decongestants or cough suppressants, to help manage your symptoms. If you're not experiencing relief from OTC expectorants, it's a good idea to consult with your doctor to discuss other treatment options or to rule out any underlying conditions that may need attention. I hope this helps you understand expectorants better, and I wish you relief from your cough soon!\nThat's really helpful, thanks! I've been taking guaifenesin, but I'm not sure if it's doing much for me. I might need to talk to my doctor about other options. By the way, I'm also experiencing some occasional heartburn and acid reflux symptoms. Can you tell me more about what might be causing it and how I can manage it?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"00ca467f:answer_39900a0a_3\"}"}
{"document":3,"title":"user in #00ca467f:answer_39900a0a_2: I've been dealing with a lingering cough for weeks...","updated_at":"2023-03-27T08:16:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I want to ask, can you provide some information on EMG tests? What should I expect during the test, and how long does it usually take?","metadata":"{\"Channel\": \"00ca467f:answer_39900a0a_2\"}"}
